{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人曾展望（GM）在無綫節目《試真D唷》中，深入台灣不同地方探索評價兩極的店舖，親身上陣為觀眾「試伏」。</p><p>近日，GM將節目搬到私下，和女友葉蒨文（Sophie）來個《試真D唷》番外篇，前往AI推介的健康料理餐廳進行食評。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:20:34.589164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_hash":"285d83cbd5b721080f43180ce7051d70054cdc2db743402a8c64001ecd49452c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}